  "_sectionRoles": {
    "intro": "Sets the key and the pulse. Thinner than the hook — it is a runway.",
    "gesture": "A single rising or falling figure. The whole point of a sting.",
    "motif": "The identity cell: 3-5 notes with one leap. Repeatable, hummable, no groove needed.",
    "hook": "The memorable phrase. Densest melodic writing; everything else supports it.",
    "answer": "The hook's reply — same rhythm, different contour, or the same contour a step away.",
    "lift": "One bar of rising tension into the button. Often a fill or a held dominant.",
    "button": "The ending. An accent on beat 1, held and allowed to ring. NOTHING after it."
  },
